% The contract the annual return obligation starts: its first obligations.
when the contract the annual return obligation starts on day a day with charity a charity
    and the charity status of the charity is a value
    and the value is equal to active
    and a due day = day + 60
then the annual return obligation obliges the_charity to file the annual return by day the due day as its first obligation.

when the contract the annual return obligation starts on day a day with charity a charity
    and the charity status of the charity is a value
    and the value is different from active
then the contract is fulfilled.

% The first obligation of the annual return obligation: met, or its deadline missed.
when a party does file the annual return on day a day
    and the annual return obligation obliges the party to file the annual return by day a due day as its first obligation
    and the day <= the due day
then the contract is fulfilled
    and it is not the case that the annual return obligation obliges the party to file the annual return by day the due day as its first obligation.

when something happens on day a day
    and the annual return obligation obliges a party to file the annual return by day a due day as its first obligation
    and the day > the due day
    and a second due day = day + 14
then the annual return obligation obliges the_commissioner to issue a required steps notice by day the second due day as its second obligation
    and it is not the case that the annual return obligation obliges the party to file the annual return by day the due day as its first obligation.

% The second obligation of the annual return obligation: met, or its deadline missed.
when a party does issue a required steps notice on day a day
    and the annual return obligation obliges the party to issue a required steps notice by day a due day as its second obligation
    and the day <= the due day
    and a second due day = day + 30
then the correction period obliges the_charity to correct the deficiencies by day the second due day as its first obligation
    and it is not the case that the annual return obligation obliges the party to issue a required steps notice by day the due day as its second obligation.

when something happens on day a day
    and the annual return obligation obliges a party to issue a required steps notice by day a due day as its second obligation
    and the day > the due day
then the contract is breached by the_commissioner because "failed to issue notice"
    and it is not the case that the annual return obligation obliges the party to issue a required steps notice by day the due day as its second obligation.

% The first obligation of the correction period: met, or its deadline missed.
when a party does correct the deficiencies on day a day
    and the correction period obliges the party to correct the deficiencies by day a due day as its first obligation
    and the day <= the due day
then the contract is fulfilled
    and it is not the case that the correction period obliges the party to correct the deficiencies by day the due day as its first obligation.

when something happens on day a day
    and the correction period obliges a party to correct the deficiencies by day a due day as its first obligation
    and the day > the due day
then the contract is breached by the_charity because "failed to correct after notice"
    and it is not the case that the correction period obliges the party to correct the deficiencies by day the due day as its first obligation.

